# Backend file size and one concern

Core and Convex server files stay **under 600 lines**. Go over that only when a split would lie about the design. Leave a one-line comment at the top of the file explaining why.

One file is one concern, like a TanStack Router API route: one URL, one loader. Here that is one command, one adapter, or one shared helper.

When two concerns share a file, split them. Create-workspace and record-cash-expense do not live together. Period calendar math does not live inside the cash-expense command. The Convex store adapter does not live inside a mutation wrapper.

```text
# ❌ one 600+ line factory of every command
src/accounting/accounting.ts

# ✅ one command per file, factory only wires them
src/accounting/commands/recordCashExpense.ts
src/accounting/core.ts
```

`convex/_generated/**` is excluded from this rule.
